# Auspex

The contract is [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md). This product drives local Chrome. It does not use Solari.

```bash
cargo build --release
./target/release/auspex check --name ironadamant
./target/release/auspex login --url https://app.example
./target/release/auspex check --profile <name> --url https://app.example --expect "<words>" --verify-with-profile
```

`ok`, `claimOk`, and `claimOkProfile` stay apart. Reuse a saved login only when `claimOkProfile` is true. The agent never types a password. Do not record a logged-in session. Hornet Swarm is optional. If it is missing, use local Chrome.
